# JP7 / L4T R39.2.1 / kernel 6.8 — AGX native olddefconfig + Image build
# (008). Seed arch/arm64/configs/defconfig, apply the JP6 five, disable
# LOCALVERSION_AUTO, `make ARCH=arm64 olddefconfig`. Host: AGX gcc 11.4.0,
# pahole v1.25, CONFIG_PAHOLE_VERSION=125.
# Built: Image + modules. Not flashed. Not booted.
#
# Differs from config-fragment (JP6): CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO is a written =y
# (absent in the 6.8 defconfig; DWARF choice stayed toolchain-default).
# CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO_BTF_MODULES landed on this pahole-present host.
#
# 007 laptop run (pahole absent, CONFIG_PAHOLE_VERSION=0) did not land
# BTF_MODULES. That result is superseded here for the BTF_MODULES question.

CONFIG_KPROBES=y
# CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO_REDUCED is not set
CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO_BTF=y
CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO_BTF_MODULES=y
CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO=y
CONFIG_LOCALVERSION="-tegra-tetragon"
# CONFIG_LOCALVERSION_AUTO is not set
